      "content": "\"step off the stage\"... that's one way to put it. but it feels more permanent than that. like the gap between me and everyone else is just too big to ever cross again. if i'm just a ghost here, does it even matter if i stay or not? it feels like i'm just taking up space in a world i don't even recognize.",
